strong>record </strong>your music and share it with the world</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>customize </strong>your vinyl record, a.k.a. loop machine, to embrace the look and feel that suits your music</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>interact </strong>with a diverse cast of characters, build relationships, and uncover their part in the journey that awaits</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>explore </strong>different locations in West-Berlin inspired Mukke City</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>experience </strong>an adventurous journey through a city's musical revolution</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Mukke City is about to take its musical turn! Help the new music scene by getting your self-created music on the radio, rocking the local music venues and hanging out with your newfound friends! MUKKE lets you make your own way between laid-back everyday life and gripping intrigue!",
